### Base URL
@host = http://localhost:8084

### ============================================================
### 1. Basic AI Question
### GET /api/ai/ask
### ============================================================

GET {{host}}/api/ai/ask

### ============================================================
### 2. Streaming Response
### GET /api/ai/stream
### ============================================================

GET {{host}}/api/ai/stream
Accept: text/event-stream

### ============================================================
### 3. Prompt Template
### GET /api/ai/ask2
### ============================================================

GET {{host}}/api/ai/ask2?domain=Spring%20AI&question=What%20are%20the%20main%20features%20of%20Spring%20AI?

### Another ask2 example
GET {{host}}/api/ai/ask2?domain=Docker&question=Explain%20the%20difference%20between%20Docker%20volumes%20and%20bind%20mounts.


### ============================================================
### 4. PromptTemplate with External File
### GET /api/ai/ask3
### ============================================================

GET {{host}}/api/ai/ask3?domain=Java&question=Explain%20the%20difference%20between%20an%20interface%20and%20an%20abstract%20class.


### Another ask3 example
GET {{host}}/api/ai/ask3?domain=PostgreSQL&question=What%20is%20the%20purpose%20of%20an%20index?


### ============================================================
### 5. Structured Output - Actor Filmography
### GET /api/ai/str-ask
### ============================================================

GET {{host}}/api/ai/str-ask


