### ============================================================

GET {{host}}/api/ai/suggest-projects?techStack=Java%2CSpring%20Boot%2CPostgreSQL


### Another project suggestion
GET {{host}}/api/ai/suggest-projects?techStack=Python%2CFastAPI%2CMachine%20Learning


