### 8. Free-form User Prompt
### GET /api/ai/ask
### ============================================================

GET {{host}}/api/ai/ask?message=Explain%20Spring%20AI%20in%20simple%20terms


### Another free-form prompt
GET {{host}}/api/ai/ask?message=What%20is%20the%20difference%20between%20RAG%20and%20fine-tuning%3F
